@lang en
IMPORT daydate

-- THE VINTAGES of Law 08/2022/QH15: the dates every dated arm in every rule module reads.
-- A vintage is an INPUT, never a merge (BRIEF.md): it is the rule-version axis,
-- `RULES EFFECTIVE DATE`, pinned in a test by `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT`.
--
--   V1  1 January 2023 to 31 December 2025   the Law as made (Dieu 156(1))
--   V2  from 1 January 2026                   V1 with Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1 and 2 applied,
--                                             except Dieu 2(6) and 2(8)  (Dieu 3(1) of that Law)
--   V3  from 1 July 2026                      V2 with Dieu 2(6) and 2(8) also applied
--                                             (Dieu 3(2) of that Law)
--
-- The V1 commencement:
@@q 524 525
-- The commencement of Law 139/2025/QH15:
@@qa 343 347

§ `The vintages`

GIVETH A DATE
`the date Law 08/2022/QH15 took effect (V1 begins)` MEANS YMD 2023 1 1

GIVETH A DATE
`the date Law 139/2025/QH15 took effect (V2 begins)` MEANS YMD 2026 1 1

GIVETH A DATE
`the date Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 2(6) and 2(8) took effect (V3 begins)` MEANS YMD 2026 7 1

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the rules in force are those of V3` MEANS
    `RULES EFFECTIVE DATE` AT LEAST `the date Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 2(6) and 2(8) took effect (V3 begins)`

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the rules in force are those of V2 or later` MEANS
    `RULES EFFECTIVE DATE` AT LEAST `the date Law 139/2025/QH15 took effect (V2 begins)`

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the rules in force are those of V1 or later` MEANS
    `RULES EFFECTIVE DATE` AT LEAST `the date Law 08/2022/QH15 took effect (V1 begins)`
